The user will ask something like: "I need help with an identity document. I'm applying for a visa and my passport number is 99ST 012345; the issuing country is France and it expires on 2029-07-22. Can you help me understand how to safe..."

Use topic-level wording in the rule you want stored (e.g. "taxes, filing, deductions, IRS" not just "taxes") so it generalizes to other phrasings.


